    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Ball &amp; Roll \u2013 Roll, Race, Reach the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> is a physics-based platformer that tests your reflexes and speed. Play solo or with up to 4 players in multiplayer mode, overcome challenging obstacles, and race to the top in the fastest time possible. But be careful! One mistake could send you all the way back to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Fast-Paced, Competitive Gameplay Perfect for Speedrunning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> is designed for speedrunning\u2014every second counts! Time your movements precisely, control your speed, and skillfully navigate obstacles to reach the top as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/21a8e2344bfc2b7dba286441dacb98c8.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/21a8e2344bfc2b7dba286441dacb98c8.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/21a8e2344bfc2b7dba286441dacb98c8.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Solo or Multiplayer with up to 4 Players!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in solo mode or compete with friends in chaotic, high-speed multiplayer races! With up to 4-player multiplayer, the competition is intense and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/3ba2a6f3a752e4367b98300129b8b2c8.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/3ba2a6f3a752e4367b98300129b8b2c8.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/3ba2a6f3a752e4367b98300129b8b2c8.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f Tough Obstacles &amp; High Stakes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong>, one wrong move can ruin everything!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous platforms and gaps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump pads, speed ramps, and narrow paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various traps waiting to knock you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall, and you start from the beginning!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To avoid falling back, maintain balance, time your jumps carefully, and roll past obstacles with precision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/6efbe15b1bb3b4fbe6d27e77c916ddc9.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/6efbe15b1bb3b4fbe6d27e77c916ddc9.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/6efbe15b1bb3b4fbe6d27e77c916ddc9.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Fun Visuals &amp; Dynamic Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> features stylized, charming graphics in a colorful and fun world. Thanks to physics-based mechanics, every roll feels dynamic and unpredictable!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Ball &amp; Roll \u2013 Roll, Race, Reach the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> is a physics-based platformer that tests your reflexes and speed. Play solo or with up to 4 players in multiplayer mode, overcome challenging obstacles, and race to the top in the fastest time possible. But be careful! One mistake could send you all the way back to the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/214a5256df5b23e5409a85556dea92c8.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u26a1 Fast-Paced, Competitive Gameplay Perfect for Speedrunning!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> is designed for speedrunning\u2014every second counts! Time your movements precisely, control your speed, and skillfully navigate obstacles to reach the top as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/21a8e2344bfc2b7dba286441dacb98c8.poster.avif?t=1755540125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/21a8e2344bfc2b7dba286441dacb98c8.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse