ight=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/6efbe15b1bb3b4fbe6d27e77c916ddc9.webm?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589720/extras/6efbe15b1bb3b4fbe6d27e77c916ddc9.mp4?t=1755540125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Fun Visuals &amp; Dynamic Physics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ball &amp; Roll</strong> features stylized, charming graphics in a colorful and fun world. Thanks to physics-based mechanics, every roll feels dynamic and unpredictable!</p>",
    "short_description": "Ball &amp; Roll is a physics-based platform game that you can play solo or with friends! Control your cute animal inside a rolling ball, overcome challenging obstacles, move fast, and reach the top as quickly as possible. But be careful... One mistake can send you all the way back to the start!",
